   969	        # Upstream.list_tools), so it never issues a nextCursor — and a cursor it never
   970	        # issued cannot be honoured. Refusing beats forwarding it into upstream cursor
   971	        # spaces it cannot belong to, which corrupted per-upstream pagination silently.
