  1122	            # collision handling, so an unconditional write could hijack a name another
  1123	            # upstream legitimately published — the phase-3 panel's worst finding, a
  1124	            # wrong-tool execution. Names this leaves stale are corrected by the next
  1125	            # full tools/list, which rebuilds the table with the real collision policy.
