  1225	        "here. You will likely also see other Xcode-adjacent MCP servers configured "
  1226	        "alongside — commonly xcode-mcp-server (a third-party tool, Drew's) and "
  1227	        "XcodeBuildMCP. That overlap is INTENTIONAL, not a conflict to resolve. If a "
  1228	        "call here fails or behaves inconsistently, try the equivalent tool on one of "
  1229	        "the others instead of giving up — and if one consistently works better or "
  1230	        "worse for a task, say so out loud in your response; that is wanted "
  1231	        "information."
  1232	        if fronts_mcpbridge else "")
