  1238	            f"(`{u0.command} {' '.join(u0.args)}`), serving {shown}. One approved "
  1239	            "daemon stays up instead of each client spawning its own copy.\n\n"
  1240	            "If a call says 'not connected right now', this daemon is already retrying "
