    41	    This class abstracts away the complexity of session management, event storage,
    42	    and request handling for StreamableHTTP transports. It handles:
    43	
    44	    1. Session tracking for clients
    45	    2. Resumability via an optional event store
    46	    3. Connection management and lifecycle
    47	    4. Request handling and transport setup
    48	    5. Idle session cleanup via optional timeout
